{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52537","headline":"和王采访重九见访 · 陈元光","name":"和王采访重九见访","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"河北推儒雅，嵩高降岳神。\n明径通桂掖，飞幰渡荆津。\n明快宜朝美，疏通亦我怜。\n怒同雷电厉，喜沛雨霖恩。\n乔木家声旧，严轺帝命新。\n心交今管[鲍]（饱），筹运访张陈。\n是日登高节，伊谁送酒频。\n江州华胄使，携榼再殷懃。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈元光","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52537.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52537","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}